          "endMs": 77500
        },
        {
          "en": "• Say, \"Without looking in the book, tell me one naughty or good thing the children did.\"",
          "zh": "• 说， 没有看在……里这书， 告诉我一顽皮的或者好的东西这孩子们做。",
